  "answer": "CLQA-Wiki、2WikiMultiHop 与 MusicBrainz-x-Wikidata 的关系在证据中并未被并列解释：证据只指出“All these datasets are primarily focused on multi-hop and comparison-type questions”[chunk_f8b1ae3d38356062df26e776ba255c06]，这支持把多跳作为这些数据集的共同关注点，但没有给出 CLQA-Wiki 或 2WikiMultiHop 各自如何定义多跳。交并逻辑被描述为这些数据集关注不足的问题：“less attention is paid to questions involving intersection and union logic, which are also very common in reality”[chunk_f8b1ae3d38356062df26e776ba255c06]；证据还用交集问题举例说明答案可为集合“[Mongolia, Kazakhstan, North Korea]”[chunk_f8b1ae3d38356062df26e776ba255c06]，但未说明 CLQA-Wiki 或 2WikiMultiHop 本身包含何种交并逻辑。跨 KG 则由 MusicBrainz-x-Wikidata 的构造说明：“containing 109 questions that require reasoning with information from both MusicBrainz and Wikidata”[chunk_f4962498025654850621ee329d0af7d6]，且该数据集没有既有数据可供沿用：“There is no existing dataset that requires synthesizing information from multiple KGs to answer individual questions”[chunk_f4962498025654850621ee329d0af7d6]。关于这些属性是否互相排斥，证据没有直接主张；只能说交并逻辑被列为既有数据集较少关注的方向[chunk_f8b1ae3d38356062df26e776ba255c06]，而跨 KG 被描述为一个新的多 KG 综合需求[chunk_f4962498025654850621ee329d0af7d6]，不足以推出互斥关系。",
